window.products.push({"id":808024,"name":"Brillante Stainless Steel Jelly Roll Style Pan For Baking Cakes, Roasting Vegetables Or Use As A Cookie Sheet - Made in the USA - Food Grade 316 Stain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AOoSXyJHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a tough stainless steel baking pan to replace the flimsy, rusty one you’ve been using? Reducing your exposure to potentially toxic leaching from the aluminum cookware in your kitchen? Does it disappoint you that virtually all the stainless steel baking pans you’ve seen available are low quality products produced in China, India or Thailand? There’s good news: With a Brillante™ stainless steel baking pan you’ll have a tough, highly rust and warp resistant piece of bakeware that you can use in your kitchen for years to come. WHY BRILLANTE™ PANS ARE BETTER: -2x Thicker than competing pans & genuine 316 stainless steel (18/10) means you get a strong, extremely corrosion resistant pan -No aluminum, no non-stick coatings -No frustrating labels to leave adhesive residue on your pan -Made in the USA The bottom of our pans are flat (no valleys or ridges) right up to the vertical edge-walls for ease of cleaning. A vertical edge makes it easier to scoop food from the pan without it slipping up and over the edge. It also helps to contain cooking oils and liquids from juicy foods. Our Guarantee We want you to know we back-up our products with great customer service and our 60 day guarantee (days from delivery) that if you’re not happy with your Brillante™ baking pan we’ll make it up to you with a no-hassle full refund. Brillante™ pans are offered on Amazon exclusively by fifetradingco so you can be sure quality is consistent when you order. So go ahead! Click the Add To Cart button now and warm up the oven for some baking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AOoSXyJHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brillante","source_asin":"B00M4BW6PA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-808024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M4BW6PA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M4BW6PA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
