window.products.push({"id":808044,"name":"KAHLA Five Senses Espresso Cup 3 oz, Wonderland Color, 1 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WWi+Z3V6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Say it with flowers with the Wonderland décor. Stylised vines in retro-design by Swiss designer Flavia Fleming bring a cheerful mood to the table. The FIVE SENSES cups and mugs are pure and simple in their design. The FIVE SENSES espresso cup is a slim, elegant cup for the enjoyment of the perfect espresso. Do you love to lend a hand in the kitchen – even if there is not time for a grand meal every day? FIVE SENSES is porcelain for people who enjoy cooking and eating with all their senses. Many clever details surprise with their ingenuity or put a smile on your face. The cups are slightly shifted off-centre on the saucers to allow more space for spoons, sugar cubes and chocolate biscuits. The spoon fits under the lid of the sugar bowl – we call it Sugar loaf. The cut of the plates is slanted – this prevents spills and crumbs on the table but also allows an easier access for knife, fork and spoon. There are beautiful bowls in all proportions and sizes imaginable and baking tins for delicious dishes from the oven. FIVE SENSES was awarded eight international design awards. Kahla porcelain is dishwasher safe and microwave safe. We hope you enjoy our products made in Germany using environmentally and socially sustainable production practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WWi+Z3V6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAHLA - PORCELAIN FOR THE SENSES","source_asin":"B005IXFPPO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-808044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005IXFPPO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005IXFPPO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
