window.products.push({"id":808633,"name":"Air Conditioner Fan，USB Portable Air Cooler Small Desktop Cooling Fan Humidifier Purifier Noiseless Evaporative Air Humidifier for Room Office Desktop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L3D19Hj7L._AC_SL1463_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: ABS/PP/PC electronic components Size: 3.35 * 2.95* 8.5 inch Weight: 1.76lb (0.8KG) Voltage: 5V Output Power: 4W Capacity: 350ml Cooling fan had made FCC,CE,ROSH,PSE Certification,keep your and your family safe.Rated voltage is DC 5V,Power 4W(Freon Free, Energy Efficient).  Not INCLUDE BATTERY Feature: -3 Gear wind speed:(High / Medium / Low),  Adjustable 10 seconds gust mode -Negative ions can refresh the air, promote the body's metabolism, improve work efficiency and help Improve sleep -The led night light function can bring a warm sleep atmosphere, suitable for placement in your baby's bedroom -Wind outlet blade can be 120° adjusted up and down like air conditioning. -Suitable for office desk,dining table, computer desk,bedroom etc. Super Portable: When you go out, travel, do housework, at bedroom, you need a cooling system you can move around easily. Our air conditioner fan is super portable! Mini size, with ice cubes put in, cooling wind comes out, amazing!!! You can easily pack it into your suitcase. Air cooler with 350ml Leakproof water tank and tip-over protection, keeps your dry.and the tank uses intelligent drip design,it can last 6 hours. How To Use? 1. Pull the water tank out of the bottom of the product 2. Add some pure water in Tthe tank by water bottle, also can put some ice cubes or essential oil with water, then close it. (Note: Recommend adding 3/4 water of the tank, do not full filled.) 3.Adjust the wind shutter direction 4.Press the power button , the fan starts to work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L3D19Hj7L._AC_SL1463_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B07V6XNHHP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-808633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V6XNHHP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V6XNHHP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
