window.products.push({"id":808943,"name":"Tupperware Rectangular Cake Taker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316XVMMN0JL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Tupperware cake and cupcake taker, picture shows scratches on the cake side from cutting a cake, otherwise in excellent condition Amazon.com Sturdy, ingeniously designed, and capable of transporting a 9-by-13-inch cake or 18 cupcakes, Tupperware's rectangular Cake Taker goes to a birthday party or picnic in style--or keeps sweets fresh on the counter. Key to the Cake Taker's versatility is its reversible tray. One side is flat and has a slightly raised rolled edge so a cake can easily slide onto it but still be sliced without impediment. The other side has 18 raised circles to hold standard-size cupcakes (2-1/4-inch-diameter bottoms) and prevent them from moving around. The cover locks onto the tray securely with tabs that insert into the slots on the tray and are held in place by sliding clips. The handle is built into the cover and doesn't wobble. Handles on the tray's ends ensure it can be carried securely for serving. Overall, the Cake Taker measures 17 inches long, 11-1/4 inches wide, and 6 inches high--which is deep enough to accommodate a two-layer cake--and looks great on the counter. It's made of rigid, rugged plastic. Virtually unbreakable and dishwasher-safe, Tupperware carries a lifetime warranty against chipping, cracking, breaking, and peeling. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316XVMMN0JL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tupperware","source_asin":"B00005S6IQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-808943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005S6IQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005S6IQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":808944,"name":"Best Grip and Lather Shave Bowl - Blue Handmade Pottery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7168es9-IDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This shaving bowl is designed and handcrafted by a potter who uses the bowl for shaving with a puck soap, brush and razor. This bowl is about 2.3 inches tall and 4 inches wide. This bowl is unique in that only the rim of the bowl is glazed. The textured, unglazed sides give the hand an excellent surface to grip even when wet. The unglazed interior of the bowl helps a soap puck to stay in place and whip up lather much easier than a glazed surface. This bowl is thrown and altered on the wheel. As Jay throws the pot on the wheel, it is altered by pulling indentations into the sides. These side pulls aid in helping the lathering process and make the bowls easy to hold. The shaving bowl is designed to fit a 3\" standard soap puck. The bowl is also a decorative item to hold your keys and change. If you are interested in similar shaving bowls in different colors, such as blue, purple, white and green, type JaysClay into the Amazon search bar and you will see the other items available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7168es9-IDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01BJ40B90","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-808944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BJ40B90","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BJ40B90","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
